@base = http://localhost:8080/fhir

### Capacidades y version del servidor
GET {{base}}/metadata
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Pacientes sinteticos
GET {{base}}/Patient?_count=10
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Paciente individual
GET {{base}}/Patient/p5
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Diagnosticos del paciente
GET {{base}}/Condition?subject=Patient/p5
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Glucosa del paciente
GET {{base}}/Observation?subject=Patient/p5&code=http://loinc.org|2345-7
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Carga idempotente: cuerpo desde archivo, compatible con REST Client de VS Code
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Accept: application/fhir+json

< ./transaction.json
